<?xml version="1.0"?>
<model>
  <name>bq410_base</name>
  <version>1.3</version>
  <sdf version="1.9">model.sdf</sdf>
  <author>
    <name>John Oula</name>
    <email>john.oula@bams-tech.com</email>
  </author>
  <description>BQ-410 quadrotor base airframe for PX4 SITL. Mass 1.131 kg all-up (1.083 kg measured base + 4 x 12 g DJI 9450 props), inertia from estimated full-vehicle MOI (Jxx 0.009749, Jyy 0.008251, Jzz 0.014972 kg m^2), X-configuration with rotor positions from BQ-410-RS.params (CA_ROTOR). Includes IMU, barometer, magnetometer and GNSS sensors. Body visual updated 2026-08-03 from q410-gz-body.blend (glTF, single collision box fit to new geometry); propellers unchanged. Rotor positions corrected 2026-08-03: located the actual motor shaft holes on the Q410 body mesh (clean 3.000mm-radius circular holes at each arm tip) and moved all 4 rotor poses to match, replacing the previous approximate values (which were off by about 18mm in X and 7-8mm in Z). Transforms re-corrected 2026-08-03: base_link's origin moved in the source Blender file (q410-gz-body.blend), so the collision box and all 4 rotor positions were recomputed relative to its current origin.</description>
</model>
